{"id":"n71114-2-7","stage":0,"title":"음식 · 食物","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71114-2-7-1","ko":"저 강아지한테 남은 음식을 줘도 되나요?","zh":"可以把剩下的食物给那只小狗吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강아지한테","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남은","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘도","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryI